@startuml
title Digidoclocker State Diagram

state "Initial" as Initial
Initial : entry/no user interaction

state Registering as Registering
Registering : do/register citizen
Registering : exit/register complete

state LoggingIn as LoggingIn
LoggingIn : do/login attempt
LoggingIn : exit/login successful

state DocumentUploading as DocumentUploading
DocumentUploading : do/upload document
DocumentUploading : exit/document upload complete

state ProfileViewing as ProfileViewing
ProfileViewing : do/view profile
ProfileViewing : exit/profile view complete

state CertificateApplying as CertificateApplying
CertificateApplying : do/apply for certificate
CertificateApplying : exit/certificate application complete

state ReapplyingForCertificates as ReapplyingForCertificates
ReapplyingForCertificates : do/reapply for certificate
ReapplyingForCertificates : exit/certificate reapplication complete

state RegistrarRequestingCertificates as RegistrarRequestingCertificates
RegistrarRequestingCertificates : do/request certificate
RegistrarRequestingCertificates : exit/certificate request complete

state ContinuingDocumentUploads as ContinuingDocumentUploads
ContinuingDocumentUploads : do/continue upload
ContinuingDocumentUploads : exit/upload session ongoing

state SessionEnding as SessionEnding
SessionEnding : do/end session
SessionEnding : exit/session ended

[*] --> Initial

Initial --> Registering : user enters details
Registering --> LoggingIn : citizen registers
LoggingIn --> DocumentUploading : login successful
LoggingIn --> ProfileViewing : login successful
LoggingIn --> CertificateApplying : login successful

DocumentUploading --> ContinuingDocumentUploads : need to upload more documents
ProfileViewing --> CertificateApplying : user wants to apply for a certificate
CertificateApplying --> ReapplyingForCertificates : user wants to reapply for another certificate
ReapplyingForCertificates --> CertificateApplying : user wants to apply again

RegistrarRequestingCertificates --> LoggingIn : registrar logs in
LoggingIn --> RegistrarRequestingCertificates : login successful

SessionEnding --> [*]

@enduml
